flowchart LR
    Requesters["Сервисы-заказчики"] -->|translation requests| KafkaIn["Kafka request topics"]
    KafkaIn --> Consumer["Priority / regular consumers"]
    Consumer --> Jobs[("Owner PostgreSQL: jobs and attempts")]
    Jobs --> Worker["Dispatcher / техническое исполнение"]
    Worker -->|opaque text + languages| Provider["Непрозрачный провайдер перевода<br/>Не выбран; не входит в full-local"]
    Provider -->|translation or bounded error| Worker
    Worker --> Outbox[("Transactional outbox")]
    Outbox -->|translation results| KafkaOut["Kafka result topics"]
    API["Operator / diagnostic API"] --> Jobs
    Jobs --> Status["Platform UI status publisher"]
    Worker --> Telemetry["Telemetry sender"]
